For each tool you list, provide at least:

- Name
- Primary use-case(s)
- High-level capabilities (no exploit instructions)
- License model (FOSS / commercial / freemium / hosted SaaS, etc.)
- Primary platform(s) (Linux, Windows, Mac, container, cloud-native)
