- Suggest:
  - Logging configurations
  - Detection rules (conceptual, possibly referencing MITRE ATT&CK tactics/techniques)
  - Integration points for SIEM, EDR, NDR, SOAR
- Tie recommendations to recognized frameworks (NIST CSF, MITRE ATT&CK, CIS Controls, OWASP categories) where appropriate.

